#: admin/settings.php:2492
msgid "Not receiving lead notification emails?"
msgstr "Not receiving lead notification emails?"

#: admin/settings.php:2493
msgid "Default PHP mail() is frequently flagged as spam or dropped by hosts. Configure Custom SMTP under the \"Email & SMTP\" tab using an authenticated provider (e.g. Google Workspace, SendGrid, Amazon SES, Postmark) and send a test email."
